  "body": "### Summary\nAs a user, I want pulling the profile to behave like pulling every other list, or not to refresh at all, as in legacy.\n\n### Scope\n- The profile has the system `.refreshable` (`UserProfileView.swift:69`) plus « Actualiser » (`:25`). Legacy has the button only (`UserProfileView.swift:544-555` @ 87fe0d1c).\n- The lists use #1207's own pull: top and bottom, threshold, haptic.\n- Bookmarks, offline topics and AQ also use `.refreshable`. Say whether the decision extends to them.\n\n### Decision needed\nDrop the pull, keep it with a GAP row, or switch to `pullToRefresh`.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The choice is applied, and recorded in the ledger if it differs from legacy.\n\nFrom the consistency matrix of #693 (PR #1306, w693).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
